6","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9467991590499878,"text_excerpt":"This Starbucks location is really cool. Since they've been open, the tall gentleman barista (don't know his name but he reminds me of David from QVC) has been so nice and helpful in my indecisive choices lol.... Though this spot has little and tight parking spots, it's best you park across in the median area, and it gets really crowded at different times of the busy day. Also the location is easy without having to drive deep into Metairie or downtown if you are near the Lakefront, N.O.East, or Mid City areas."},{"business_id":"RCy4M2ND4YK0uRbodV_v8g","review_id":"HMivEKhrVCx806JS68mO2g","date":"2013-09-28T02:14:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.937826931476593,"text_excerpt":"I usually come to this Starbucks because it's in my neighborhood. I must say the location is nice sice it's right on Harrison. However, the inside space is quite small, even though there is plenty of outdoor space (which is really unpleasant during the summer months). I must say though that the staff is really friendly. I remember one time I went there, I wasn't sure what I wanted and the barista guided me in the right direction. All in all, this is a good place to come to study, catch up with friends, or just get your daily caffeine fix."},{"business_id":"RCy4M2ND4YK0uRbodV_v8g","review_id":"z8hEne5Tb70iyUJR93bKMg","date":"2014-12-31T02:53:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9375351667404175,"text_excerpt":"I love Starbucks especially the one on Harrison! I love the frappachinos...my favorites being the green tea and the pumkin spice, which is a seasonal flavor for fall. When I go with my friends, we usually would sit outside since it is usually packed inside and really cold. Even during the winter, we sit outside. A negative is there isn't much seating inside. There also isn't a drive-thru. I love how the workers are really helpful and will even give out free samples of coffee packets. One time they were about to close and gave me a bunch of cookies to take home. Regardless, Starbucks remains one of my favorite coffee shops."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RCy4M2ND4YK0uRbodV_v8g","photo_id":"kny7Rs7XeD9uU1Krv0pMsA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/kny7Rs7XeD9uU1Krv0pMsA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9152758121490479},{"business_id":"RCy4M2ND4YK0uRbodV_v8g","photo_id":"NM3Xo0JtmSyDlPnQUJ-W2w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NM3Xo0JtmSyDlPnQUJ-W2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8956725001335144},{"business_id":"RCy4M2ND4YK0uRbodV_v8g","photo_id":"kC6SinE_PSEi39WRNGoKSQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/kC6SinE_PSEi39WRNGoKSQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.864797055721283},{"business_id":"RCy4M2ND4YK0uRbodV_v8g","photo_id":"xc_qNUzUkJ2VNQvF2Z1wQg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xc_qNUzUkJ2VNQvF2Z1wQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.860924482345581},{"business_id":"RCy4M2ND4YK0uRbodV_v8g","photo_id":"Pbm6y3_lIXdk9KCqTpNudA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Pbm6y3_lIXdk9KCqTpNudA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8101338744163513}]},"notebook_case":null}
